setrate 400
op add sy sy 1
read x cell1 sy
read y cell2 sy
read hp cell3 sy
read dp cell4 sy
read r cell5 sy
read ax cell6 sy
read ay cell7 sy
jump 11 equal hp 0
jump 13 always un null
set sy 0
jump 2 always un null
jump 15 always dp 0
jump 38 always x false
jump 18 notEqual hp 0
ucontrol unbind x y 0 0 0
jump 38 always x false
set t -1
op add t t 1
fetch unit un @crux t @oct
sensor uc un @controller
jump 25 equal uc un
jump 25 equal uc @this
jump 19 always uc un
ubind un
op sub x2 ax x
op sub y2 ay y
op angle r x2 y2
op cos x2 r r
op sin y2 r r
op mul x2 x2 8
op mul y2 y2 8
op add x2 x2 x
op add y2 y2 y
ucontrol move x2 y2 0 0 0
write 1 cell4 sy
set result @unit
end
